">往</span></p><p begin="1:06.265" end="1:10.479" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.265" end="1:06.554">怎么</span><span begin="1:06.554" end="1:06.785">为</span><span begin="1:06.785" end="1:07.007">他</span> <span begin="1:07.007" end="1:07.484">失去</span><span begin="1:07.484" end="1:07.695">一</span><span begin="1:07.695" end="1:08.263">切</span><span begin="1:08.263" end="1:08.673">也无</span><span begin="1:08.673" end="1:09.059">妨</span> <span begin="1:09.156" end="1:09.412">可能</span><span begin="1:09.412" end="1:09.602">是</span><span begin="1:09.602" end="1:09.841">我</span><span begin="1:09.841" end="1:10.099">贱</span><span begin="1:10.099" end="1:10.479">吧</span></p><p begin="1:10.479" end="1:14.572" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.479" end="1:11.008">不爱我</span><span begin="1:11.008" end="1:11.215">的</span><span begin="1:11.215" end="1:11.689">非要</span><span begin="1:11.689" end="1:12.250">上</span> <span begin="1:12.402" end="1:13.074">那么硬的</span><span begin="1:13.074" end="1:13.554">南墙</span><span begin="1:13.554" end="1:13.852">非</span><span begin="1:13.852" end="1:14.001">要</span><span begin="1:14.001" end="1:14.572">撞</span></p><p begin="1:14.699" end="1:16.366" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.699" end="1:15.007">是不</span><span begin="1:15.007" end="1:15.291">是</span><span begin="1:15.291" end="1:15.674">内心</span><span begin="1:15.674" end="1:15.989">希</span><span begin="1:15.989" end="1:16.366">望</span></p><p begin="1:16.376" end="1:21.753" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.376" end="1:16.678">头</span><span begin="1:16.678" end="1:16.839">破</span><span begin="1:16.839" end="1:17.130">血</span><span begin="1:17.130" end="1:17.564">流</span> <span begin="1:17.564" end="1:18.261">就会让</span><span begin="1:18.261" end="1:18.601">你</span><span begin="1:18.601" end="1:19.448">想起</span><span begin="1:19.448" end="1:20.116">最爱我</span><span begin="1:20.116" end="1:20.399">的</span><span begin="1:20.399" end="