1:38.942">其实你不是</span><span begin="1:38.942" end="1:39.652">不爱了</span><span begin="1:39.652" end="1:40.088">吧</span> <span begin="1:40.088" end="1:40.364">只是</span><span begin="1:40.364" end="1:40.561">有</span><span begin="1:40.561" end="1:40.661">些</span><span begin="1:40.661" end="1:41.211">摩擦没</span><span begin="1:41.211" end="1:41.566">处</span><span begin="1:41.566" end="1:41.879">理</span></p><p begin="1:41.889" end="1:44.141" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.889" end="1:42.923">怎么你闭</span><span begin="1:42.923" end="1:43.148">口</span><span begin="1:43.148" end="1:43.408">不</span><span begin="1:43.408" end="1:44.141">语</span></p><p begin="1:44.230" end="1:47.355" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.230" end="1:45.445">是不是我正</span><span begin="1:45.445" end="1:45.850">好</span><span begin="1:45.850" end="1:46.351">说中</span><span begin="1:46.351" end="1:46.653">你</span><span begin="1:46.653" end="1:46.794">的</span><span begin="1:46.794" end="1:47.355">心</span></p><p begin="1:47.509" end="1:55.306" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.509" end="1:47.763">就</span><span begin="1:47.763" end="1:48.265">承认</span><span begin="1:48.265" end="1:48.691">还</span><span begin="1:48.691" end="1:48.974">是</span><span begin="1:48.974" end="1:49.291">在</span><span begin="1:49.291" end="1:49.806">意</span><span begin="1:49.806" end="1:50.367">吧</span> <span begin="1:50.517" end="1:51.049">就</span><span begin="1:51.107" end="1:51.822">骗骗</span><span begin="1:51.822" end="1:52.042">我</span><span begin="1:52.042" end="1:52.421">也</span><span begin="1:52.421" end="1:53.071">可</span><span begin="1:53.071" end="1:55.306">以</span></p></div><div begin="2:10.279" end="2:29.210" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:10.279" end="2:14.676" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.279" end="2:10.587">可</span><span begin="2:10.587" end="2:11.158">笑</span><span begin="2:11.158" end="2:11.665">吗</span> <span begin="2:11.908" end="2:12.188">你的</spa